program interior_periodic_radius2_control
tolerance 1e-10
input n: u64 range 4..100000000
field p[i in n]: f64 = -0.375 + cast(f64, (i * 37 + 11) % 2048) / 2048.0
field q[i in n]: f64 = p[periodic(i + n - 2, n)] + p[i]
sum checksum[i in n]: f64 = q[i]
output checksum
test (4) => { checksum = -2.740234375 }
